        "Both rows are in src/domain/fsm.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Unknown outcomes never resend",
      "items": [
        "ENTRY_UNCONFIRMED and EXIT_UNCONFIRMED both lead to HALTED",
        "timeout, 5xx, 401, 408, 429 or network error counts as unknown"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "HALTED stops entries, not protection",
      "items": [
        "Protective exits run while no exit is in flight",
